{"id":"1f22fd0f606ee7bd","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness.md","title":"Abstract Second Incompleteness for an HBL Predicate","display":"thm-abstract-second-incompleteness — Abstract Second Incompleteness for an HBL Predicate","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-abstract-second-incompleteness — Abstract Second Incompleteness for an HBL Predicate","source":"第 IX 章 pp. 108–110（PDF 125–127）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-thm-abstract-lob]]","[[92-df-consistent]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-abstract-second-incompleteness — Abstract Second Incompleteness for an HBL Predicate"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 pp. 108–110（PDF 125–127）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02627be788793195\" href=\"?note=02627be788793195\" title=\"92-thm-abstract-lob\">92-thm-abstract-lob</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}(B)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg f\">\\(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg f\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_B\\coloneqq\\neg\\Box_Bf\">\\(C_B\\coloneqq\\neg\\Box_Bf\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}second\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\nvdash C_B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}second\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\nvdash C_B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_B\">\\(C_B\\)</span> 可证，命题逻辑给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_Bf\\to f\">\\(\\Box_Bf\\to f\\)</span>，Löb 定理得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 可证，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg f\">\\(\\neg f\\)</span> 可证和一致性矛盾。</p>\n<p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_B\">\\(C_B\\)</span> 未必语义上表达真实一致性；只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 正确表达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 的可证码集时，这个语义解释才成立。原书特意指出抽象不可证结果不需要谓词正确性。证明路径采用 p. 110 的 Kreisel 推论；pp. 108–109 还给出直接固定点证明。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 pp. 108–110（PDF 125–127）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-abstract-lob","status":"resolved","id":"02627be788793195","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-lob]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg f","display":false},{"tex":"C_B\\coloneqq\\neg\\Box_Bf","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}second\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\nvdash C_B.","display":true},{"tex":"C_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_Bf\\to f","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg f","display":false},{"tex":"C_B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false}],"bytes":1471,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]] → [[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]] → [[92-thm-abstract-lob]] → [[92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"115b0689f1a67703","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"57ea3ea286817df3","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"以 $\\mathcal S=G$、$B=B_G$、$f=\\bot_G$ 实例化[[92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness]]。本地固定点构造给出 diagonalizable；所选证明公式明确满足 HBL，$G$ 证明 $\\neg\\bot_G$。不可证结论只用这三项及一致性；$\\mathrm{Con}_G$ 的标准真值解释还使用证明公式的语义正确性。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-259","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["02627be788793195","c7befd96bd551ade"]}